            "B": "14 सेमी",
            "C": "3.5 सेमी",
            "D": "21 सेमी"
          },
          "explanation": "2πr = 44 => 2 × 22/7 × r = 44 => 44/7 × r = 44 => r = 7।"
        }
      }
